  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 7930798571520
    m_Localized: Mysterious monsters\nare threatening the world.\nMatch the Bullet
      Girls\nand defeat the monsters.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7930798571521
    m_Localized: Match Bullet Girls\nof the same type!!\nAttack enemies\nwith their
      power.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7930798571522
    m_Localized: Match all Bullet Girls\nto trigger Popping Blast!!\nHit all enemies\nwith
      a powerful blast.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7930806960128
    m_Localized: Choose perks during battle\nto power up!!\nPerks appear based on\nyour
      Bullet Girls.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7930806960129
    m_Localized: Normal and Elite monsters\nwill appear.\nA powerful Boss awaits\nat
      the end of the stage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7930806960130
    m_Localized: Earn Gold for upgrades,\nand Stardust Cores\nfor unlocks.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7930806960131
    m_Localized: Place your Bullet Girls\nin the Deck.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7930806960132
    m_Localized: Build a deck\nwith your Bullet Girls.\nYou can use\n6 different
      girls.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7930806960133
    m_Localized: Check the\nBullet Girls' attack types.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7930806960135
    m_Localized: In Upgrade,\nyou can unlock\nand upgrade Bullet Girls.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7930806960136
    m_Localized: Use Stardust Cores\nto power up\nyour Bullet Girls.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7930806960138
    m_Localized: Check Bullet Girls\nthat have been\nupgraded.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7930806960139
    m_Localized: Next>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7930806960140
    m_Localized: End
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7930806960142
    m_Localized: '[ERROR]An unknown error has occurred.\nCODE:100<Exit>'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7930806960143
    m_Localized: '[Exit]Quit the game?<Confirm><Cancel>'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7930806960144
    m_Localized: '[Notice]Your party is incomplete.\nAssign 6 characters.<OK>'
    m_Metadata:
