    m_Localized: Attack Types
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7930806960174
    m_Localized: Standard
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7930806960175
    m_Localized: A well-rounded Bullet Girl with balanced stats and no major weaknesses.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7930806960176
    m_Localized: Breacher
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7930806960177
    m_Localized: A Bullet Girl who fires wide-spreading shots at nearby enemies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7930806960178
    m_Localized: Marksman
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7930806960179
    m_Localized: A Bullet Girl specialized in taking down pesky enemies from afar.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7930806960180
    m_Localized: Anti-Armor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7930806960181
    m_Localized: "Leave tough enemies to this Bullet Girl. Even heavy armor won\u2019t
      last long."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7930806960182
    m_Localized: Demolition
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7930806960183
    m_Localized: Wipes out enemies in a wide area with a single blast. Enjoy the
      satisfying AoE damage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7930806960184
    m_Localized: Support
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7930806960185
    m_Localized: A Bullet Girl with low firepower, but grants beneficial effects
      to allies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
